{"id":"mindestens","lemma":"mindestens","pos":"adv","rank":1211,"glosses":["at least (at a lower limit)"],"ipa":"/ˈmɪndəstəns/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e3/De-mindestens.ogg/De-mindestens.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich brauche mindestens fünf Minuten.","en":"I'm going to need at least five minutes.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},null,{"g":"five (numerical value…"},{"g":"minute (unit of time","l":"Minute"}]},{"text":"Ich habe mindestens zehn Bücher.","en":"I have at least ten books.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},null,{"g":"ten"},{"g":"book (collection of…","l":"Buch"}]},{"text":"Es wird mindestens fünf Dollar kosten.","en":"It'll cost at least five dollars.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},null,{"g":"five (numerical value…"},{"g":"dollar"},{"g":"to cost"}]},{"text":"Ich mache das mindestens einmal am Tag.","en":"I do that at least once a day.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"once, one time"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"daily, a day, per day"]]},{"text":"Mindestens drei Menschen wurden verletzt.","en":"At least three people were hurt.","words":[null,{"g":"three (numerical value…"},{"g":"human","l":"Mensch"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"hurt, injured"}]}]}